  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="PT">Assist&#xEA;ncia T&#xE9;cnica Alimentar e Nutricional II (FANTA II)</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Food and Nutrition Technical Assistance II (FANTA II)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="PT">O Projecto de Assist&#xEA;ncia T&#xE9;cnica Alimentar e Nutricional (FANTA) tem trabalhado para melhorar a sa&#xFA;de e o bem-estar de indiv&#xED;duos, fam&#xED;lias e comunidades vulner&#xE1;veis &#x200B;&#x200B;nos pa&#xED;ses em desenvolvimento, refor&#xE7;ando as pol&#xED;ticas, programas e sistemas de seguran&#xE7;a alimentar e nutricional. O projecto fornece apoio t&#xE9;cnico abrangente &#xE0; USAID e aos seus parceiros, incluindo governos dos pa&#xED;ses anfitri&#xF5;es, organiza&#xE7;&#xF5;es internacionais e organiza&#xE7;&#xF5;es n&#xE3;o-governamentais. A FANTA trabalha tanto a n&#xED;vel nacional como global, apoiando a concep&#xE7;&#xE3;o e implementa&#xE7;&#xE3;o de programas nos pa&#xED;ses em foco e aproveitando a experi&#xEA;ncia de campo para fortalecer a base de evid&#xEA;ncias, m&#xE9;todos e padr&#xF5;es globais para a programa&#xE7;&#xE3;o de seguran&#xE7;a alimentar e nutri&#xE7;&#xE3;o.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Food and Nutrition Technical Assistance Project (FANTA) has been working to improve the health and well-being of vulnerable individuals, families, and communities in developing countries by strengthening food security and nutrition policies, programs, and systems. The project provides comprehensive technical support to USAID and its partners, including host country governments, international organizations, and nongovernmental organizations. FANTA works at both the country and global levels, supporting the design and implementation of programs in focus countries, and building on field experience to strengthen the evidence base, methods, and global standards for food security and nutrition programming.</narrative>
  </description>
